# Documents dropped at the repository root are never tracked. The public mirror
# force-pushes from main, so anything committed here is published, and the
# things that land here are drafts, decks and material shared in confidence.
# Keep them here, or in an ignored folder; never in a commit.
/*.pdf
/*.zip
/*.docx
/*.key
